### Privacy & Backup Tip:
Because this application stores data directly inside your browser storage (`localStorage`):
- Avoid clearing your browser's site data/cookies or the saved patient notes will be lost.
- If you're treating real patients, make sure the computer you open this on is password-protected to remain compliant with your local health data privacy standards (e.g., HIPAA, GDPR).
